<title>GERMANY: MG metals unit restructures trading.</title>
<headline>MG metals unit restructures trading.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>German metals trading group MG Handel, a unit of Metallgesellschaft AG, said on Friday that it has restructured its non-ferrous metals and raw material trading under a new name.</p>
<p>The group said trading in Frankfurt, New York and London will be grouped under the name MG Metal &amp; Commodity.</p>
<p>MG said it was combining the Frankfurt-based MG Erz- &amp; Metallhandel GmbH, the London-based Metal &amp; Commodity Ltd and the New York-based Ore &amp; Chemicals Corp und Metal Concentrates International Inc under combined leadership.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
